**Expired auth artifacts** — rejected at authentication time; no scheduled purge of expired refresh tokens or PATs from the DB (`server/auth/authenticator.go:81–83`, `:114–115`).

**Expired memo shares** — checked at access time; share rows are not periodically deleted (`server/router/fileserver/fileserver.go:777–779`).

